title Cassette playback VOLUME at other sizes and their own densities (800x480 at 9.2 px/mm, 480x800 at 8.5): VOLUME in the SOFT slot while Take 006 plays, CARD and SOFT back after STOP
sizes 800x480 480x800
env CASSETTE_DEMO playing
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
expect text "VOLUME"
expect text "50 %"
expect notext "CARD"
shot other-volume
key x
wait 400
expect text "SOFT"
expect text "CARD"
expect notext "VOLUME"
shot other-stopped
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
